  [PASS] G1.0b  the dimensionless exponential-sphere target equals CFG44's Bcommon.target_fields (M = 1e10, h = 0.5 r_M) [imported read-only]
         measured: max |mu_mine/mu_CFG44 - 1| = 2.70e-11

